        327.38629150390625,
        474.4451904296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this section, we introduce the benchmarks we used and present the details of our evaluation process.",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        489.4343566894531,
        505.739501953125,
        498.3409118652344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Following standard LLM [25, 26] evaluation practices, we assess LLaDA across four dimensions:",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        505.8233642578125,
        497.3981628417969,
        514.7299194335938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General ability: MMLU [110], BBH [111], ARC-C [112], Hellaswag [113], TruthfulQA [114],",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        522.091796875,
        505.2453918457031,
