        609.5843505859375,
        505.74261474609375,
        618.4909057617188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Specifically, for certain benchmarks, a prompt and multiple candidate answers are provided, and",
