    {
      "text": "the model is required to compute each candidate’s conditional likelihood. The candidate with the",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        631.40234375,
        503.9973449707031,
        640.3088989257812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "highest likelihood is then selected as the model’s final answer, and accuracy is used as the evaluation",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        642.3113403320312,
